<title>USA: Lindberg Corp Q1 net per share declines.</title>
<headline>Lindberg Corp Q1 net per share declines.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			  1,105		    1,242</p>
<p> Revs			29,606		   29,502</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,877		    4,823</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings from operations for Q1 1997 were $2.2 million vs $2.5 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Lindberg attributed lower 1997 earnings to weaker results in its precision products segment, primarily at the impact industries division. Current difficulties in this segment will take time to be reversed, Lindberg said.</p>
</text>
